	(text "DUT supplies on J1 (digital v4).\nJ1 pin 17 = +3V3_DUT: U69 SY6280AAC from the pod +3V3, limit 6800/4.7k = ~1.45 A, below eFuse 2 (~2 A), so a DUT short,\nalso behind a J1-17 to J4 cable through eFuse 2, cannot pull down the pod +3V3. SY6280 blocks reverse current.\nJ1 pin 18 = +1V8_DUT: U70 AP2112K-1.8 on its own (the pod +1V8 from U52 feeds the 1.8 V LA bank through U8).\nDUT_3V3_EN (PD3) and DUT_1V8_EN (PD4): off until the firmware runs (100k pull-downs); the firmware turns both on at boot."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 40.64 154.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "bacc7cfe-53ec-46ca-aa0a-07cf3156032e")
	)
